OL,3,GNEWSAKnives found after motorway lane
OL,4,Ahogger pulled over
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men were found with knives
OL,7,Fconcealed in their pants after police
OL,8,Fcarried out a routine traffic stop for
OL,9,Flane hogging on a motorway.
OL,11,FThames Valley Police officers spotted
OL,12,Fthe Mercedes C250 on the outside lane
OL,13,Fon the M4 between Newbury and Reading
OL,14,Fin the early hours of Monday on a
OL,15,Fmostly empty carriageway.
OL,17,FWhen stopped the driver provided a
OL,18,Fpositive roadside drug test for
OL,19,Fcannabis.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
