OL,3,GNEWSAKnives found after motorway lane
OL,4,Ahogger pulled over
OL,5,
OL,6,FUsing a peach emoji in a social media
OL,7,Fpost - commonly used to symbolise a
OL,8,Fbottom - police said a "subsequent
OL,9,Fsearch in custody revealed a knife
OL,10,Fconcealed somewhere that really doesn't
OL,11,Fneed further explanation", while the
OL,12,Fpassenger had a 2ft (61cm) zombie knife
OL,13,Ftucked into his waistband.
